BLOCK 全体例外
ON BLOCK ERROR
    GOTO 異常終了
END
    **REGION 事前説明 & 入力受付
    @@statistics_statistics_TextBlock: '1'
@@statistics_statistics_Action_Submit: '2'
Display.ShowCustomDialog CardTemplateJson: '''{
  \"type\": \"AdaptiveCard\",
  \"version\": \"1.4\",
  \"id\": \"AdaptiveCard\",
  \"body\": [
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block_Text}\"
    }
  ],
  \"actions\": [
    {
      \"type\": \"Action.Submit\",
      \"id\": \"Yes\",
      \"title\": \"${Yes_Title}\",
      \"IsCancel\": false
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"Action.Submit\",
      \"id\": \"No\",
      \"title\": \"${No_Title}\"
    }
  ]
}''' ButtonPressed=> BtnResult @Text_block_Text: $'''事前説明をスキップしますか？''' @Yes_Title: $'''はい''' @No_Title: $'''いいえ'''
    IF BtnResult = $'''No''' THEN
        @@statistics_TextBlock: '9'
@@statistics_Action_Submit: '2'
Display.ShowCustomDialog CardTemplateJson: '''{
  \"type\": \"AdaptiveCard\",
  \"version\": \"1.4\",
  \"id\": \"AdaptiveCard\",
  \"body\": [
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block1\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block1_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block2\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block2_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block3\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block3_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block4\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block4_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block5\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block5_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block6\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block6_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block7\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block7_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block8\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block8_Text}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block9\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block9_Text}\"
    }
  ],
  \"actions\": [
    {
      \"type\": \"Action.Submit\",
      \"id\": \"OK\",
      \"title\": \"${OK_Title}\",
      \"IsCancel\": false
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"Action.Submit\",
      \"id\": \"Cancel\",
      \"title\": \"${Cancel_Title}\"
    }
  ]
}''' ButtonPressed=> BtnResult @Text_block1_Text: $'''事前準備''' @Text_block2_Text: $'''1, 専用のExcelファイルに勤怠時間を記載する''' @Text_block3_Text: $'''2, 1,で記載したSheetを選択し、アクティブにしておく（ファイルは閉じてもOK）''' @Text_block4_Text: $'''3, WEBブラウザ拡張機能 [Microsoft Power Automate] をインストールする''' @Text_block5_Text: $'''4, TeamSpilitにログインする（ログイン状態を保存するにチェックする）''' @Text_block6_Text: $'''5, TeamSpilitの勤怠登録画面を開いておく（何月でもOK）''' @Text_block7_Text: $'''6, 処理時間は、約3分''' @Text_block8_Text: $'''7, 完了 or エラーメッセージが表示されるまで操作しない''' @Text_block9_Text: $'''　（強制終了は、右下タスクバー → アイコン右クリック → [終了] を選択）''' @OK_Title: $'''OK''' @Cancel_Title: $'''中断'''
    END
    IF BtnResult = $'''Cancel''' THEN
        GOTO 中断終了
    END
    @@statistics_TextBlock: '1'
@@statistics_Action_Submit: '2'
Display.ShowCustomDialog CardTemplateJson: '''{
  \"type\": \"AdaptiveCard\",
  \"version\": \"1.4\",
  \"id\": \"AdaptiveCard\",
  \"body\": [
    {
      \"type\": \"TextBlock\",
      \"id\": \"Text block\",
      \"text\": \"${Text_block_Text}\"
    }
  ],
  \"actions\": [
    {
      \"type\": \"Action.Submit\",
      \"id\": \"Chrome\",
      \"title\": \"${Chrome_Title}\"
    },
    {
      \"type\": \"Action.Submit\",
      \"id\": \"Edge\",
      \"title\": \"${Edge_Title}\",
      \"IsCancel\": false
    }
  ]
}''' ButtonPressed=> BtnResult @Text_block_Text: $'''ブラウザを選択して下さい''' @Chrome_Title: $'''Chrome''' @Edge_Title: $'''Edge'''
    IF BtnResult = $'''Cancel''' THEN
        GOTO 中断終了
    END
    SET SelectBrowser TO BtnResult
    Folder.GetSpecialFolder SpecialFolder: Folder.SpecialFolder.DesktopDirectory SpecialFolderPath=> DesktopPath
    Display.SelectFileDialog.SelectFile Title: $'''勤怠時間を記載したExcelファイルを指定して下さい''' InitialDirectory: DesktopPath FileFilter: $'''*.xls*''' IsTopMost: False CheckIfFileExists: True SelectedFile=> SelectFile ButtonPressed=> BtnResult
    IF BtnResult = $'''Cancel''' THEN
        GOTO 中断終了
    END
    **ENDREGION
    **REGION 事前準備
    Excel.LaunchExcel.LaunchAndOpenUnderExistingProcess Path: SelectFile Visible: True ReadOnly: True UseMachineLocale: False Instance=> ExcelFile
    Excel.ReadFromExcel.ReadCells Instance: ExcelFile StartColumn: $'''A''' StartRow: 3 EndColumn: $'''F''' EndRow: 33 GetCellContentsMode: Excel.GetCellContentsMode.PlainText FirstLineIsHeader: False RangeValue=> ExcelRangeData
    Excel.CloseExcel.Close Instance: ExcelFile
    **ENDREGION
    **REGION メイン処理
    IF SelectBrowser = $'''Chrome''' THEN
        WebAutomation.LaunchChrome.LaunchChrome Url: $'''https://seed-it.lightning.force.com/lightning/page/home''' WindowState: WebAutomation.BrowserWindowState.Maximized ClearCache: False ClearCookies: False WaitForPageToLoadTimeout: 60 Timeout: 60 PiPUserDataFolderMode: WebAutomation.PiPUserDataFolderModeEnum.AutomaticProfile TargetDesktop: $'''{\"DisplayName\":\"ローカル コンピューター\",\"Route\":{\"ServerType\":\"Local\",\"ServerAddress\":\"\"},\"DesktopType\":\"local\"}''' BrowserInstance=> Browser
    ELSE IF SelectBrowser = $'''Edge''' THEN
        WebAutomation.LaunchEdge.LaunchEdge Url: $'''https://seed-it.lightning.force.com/lightning/page/home''' ClearCache: False ClearCookies: False WindowState: WebAutomation.BrowserWindowState.Maximized WaitForPageToLoadTimeout: 60 Timeout: 60 PiPUserDataFolderMode: WebAutomation.PiPUserDataFolderModeEnum.AutomaticProfile TargetDesktop: $'''{\"DisplayName\":\"ローカル コンピューター\",\"Route\":{\"ServerType\":\"Local\",\"ServerAddress\":\"\"},\"DesktopType\":\"local\"}''' BrowserInstance=> Browser
    END
    Text.SplitText.SplitWithDelimiter Text: ExcelRangeData[0][0] CustomDelimiter: $'''-''' IsRegEx: False Result=> YMDList
    SET ListSelect TO $'''%YMDList[0]%年%YMDList[1]%月'''
    WAIT (WebAutomation.WaitForWebPageContent.WebPageToContainElementInState BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['リスト[年月]'] State: WebAutomation.ElementState.Enabled)
    WebAutomation.SetDropDownListValue.SetDropDownListValueByName BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['リスト[年月]'] OptionNames: ListSelect UseRegularExpression: False WaitForPageToLoadTimeout: 60
    SET Success TO $'''false'''
    LOOP LoopIndex FROM 1 TO 8 STEP 1
        WebAutomation.GetDetailsOfElement BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['overlay'] AttributeName: $'''Style''' AttributeValue=> Style
        IF Contains(Style, $'''display: none''', True) THEN
            SET Success TO $'''true'''
            EXIT LOOP
        END
    END
    IF Success = $'''false''' THEN
        GOTO 異常終了
    END
    LOOP RowIdx FROM 0 TO 30 STEP 1
        Variables.CreateNewList List=> InputVals
        LOOP ColIdx FROM 0 TO 5 STEP 1
            Text.Trim Text: ExcelRangeData[RowIdx][ColIdx] TrimOption: Text.TrimOption.Both TrimmedText=> InputVal
            Variables.AddItemToList Item: InputVal List: InputVals
        END
        IF IsEmpty($'''%InputVals[2]%%InputVals[3]%%InputVals[4]%%InputVals[5]%''') THEN
            NEXT LOOP
        END
        SET PopupOpenId TO $'''ttvTimeSt%InputVals[0]%'''
        WebAutomation.PressButton.PressButtonNoWait BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['リンク[入力モーダルOPEN]']
        SET Success TO $'''false'''
        LOOP LoopIndex FROM 1 TO 8 STEP 1
            WebAutomation.GetDetailsOfElement BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['underlay'] AttributeName: $'''Style''' AttributeValue=> Style
            IF NotContains(Style, $'''display: none''', True) THEN
                SET Success TO $'''true'''
                EXIT LOOP
            END
        END
        IF Success = $'''false''' THEN
            GOTO 異常終了
        END
        WebAutomation.PopulateTextField.PopulateTextFieldNoWait BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['input[出社]'] Text: InputVals[2] Mode: WebAutomation.PopulateTextMode.Replace EmulateTyping: False UnfocusAfterPopulate: False
        WebAutomation.PopulateTextField.PopulateTextFieldNoWait BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['input[退社]'] Text: InputVals[3] Mode: WebAutomation.PopulateTextMode.Replace EmulateTyping: False UnfocusAfterPopulate: False
        WebAutomation.PopulateTextField.PopulateTextFieldNoWait BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['input[休憩1]'] Text: InputVals[4] Mode: WebAutomation.PopulateTextMode.Replace EmulateTyping: False UnfocusAfterPopulate: False
        WebAutomation.PopulateTextField.PopulateTextFieldNoWait BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['input[休憩2]'] Text: InputVals[5] Mode: WebAutomation.PopulateTextMode.Replace EmulateTyping: False UnfocusAfterPopulate: False
        WebAutomation.PressButton.PressButtonNoWait BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['ボタン[登録]']
        BLOCK 確認Dialog無しの場合
ON BLOCK ERROR

END
            WebAutomation.GetDetailsOfElement BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['モーダル[クリアの確認]'] AttributeName: $'''Style''' AttributeValue=> Style
            IF NotContains(Style, $'''display: none''', True) THEN
                WebAutomation.PressButton.PressButtonNoWait BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['ボタン[ＯＫ]']
            END
        END
        SET Success TO $'''false'''
        LOOP LoopIndex FROM 1 TO 8 STEP 1
            WebAutomation.GetDetailsOfElement BrowserInstance: Browser Control: appmask['Web Page \'h ... /page/home\'']['underlay'] AttributeName: $'''Style''' AttributeValue=> Style
            IF Contains(Style, $'''display: none''', True) THEN
                SET Success TO $'''true'''
                EXIT LOOP
            END
        END
        IF Success = $'''false''' THEN
            GOTO 異常終了
        END
    END
    WebAutomation.CloseWebBrowser BrowserInstance: Browser
    **ENDREGION
    **REGION 締め処理
    IF SelectBrowser = $'''Chrome''' THEN
        UIAutomation.FocusWindow.FocusByTitleClass Title: $'''*Google Chrome''' Class: $''''''
        MouseAndKeyboard.SendKeys.FocusAndSendKeysByControl Control: appmask['Window \'ホーム | Salesforce - Google Chrome\'']['ChromeBody'] TextToSend: $'''{F5}''' DelayBetweenKeystrokes: 10 SendTextAsHardwareKeys: False
    ELSE IF SelectBrowser = $'''Edge''' THEN
        UIAutomation.FocusWindow.FocusByTitleClass Title: $'''*Edge''' Class: $''''''
        MouseAndKeyboard.SendKeys.FocusAndSendKeysByControl Control: appmask['Window \'ホーム | Salesforce - 個人 - Microsoft​ Edge\'']['EdgeBody'] TextToSend: $'''{F5}''' DelayBetweenKeystrokes: 10 SendTextAsHardwareKeys: False
    END
    GOTO 正常終了
    **ENDREGION
END
**REGION 正常終了
LABEL 正常終了
Display.ShowMessageDialog.ShowMessage Title: $'''FNISH''' Message: $'''登録完了しました！！''' Icon: Display.Icon.None Buttons: Display.Buttons.OK DefaultButton: Display.DefaultButton.Button1 IsTopMost: True
GOTO 終了処理
**ENDREGION
**REGION 中断終了
LABEL 中断終了
Display.ShowMessageDialog.ShowMessageWithTimeout Title: $'''FNISH''' Message: $'''中断しました！！''' Icon: Display.Icon.None Buttons: Display.Buttons.OK DefaultButton: Display.DefaultButton.Button1 IsTopMost: True Timeout: 1
GOTO 終了処理
**ENDREGION
**REGION 異常終了
LABEL 異常終了
ERROR => LastError
Display.ShowMessageDialog.ShowMessage Title: $'''例外が発生しました！！''' Message: $'''エラー：
%LastError.Message%

詳細：
%LastError.ErrorDetails%''' Icon: Display.Icon.None Buttons: Display.Buttons.OK DefaultButton: Display.DefaultButton.Button1 IsTopMost: True ButtonPressed=> ButtonPressed
GOTO 終了処理
**ENDREGION
**REGION 終了処理
LABEL 終了処理
System.TerminateProcess.TerminateProcessByName ProcessName: $'''PAD.Console.Host'''
EXIT Code: 0
**ENDREGION

